# V3.6.3: build-time git-hash stamp for the LittleFS image. Regenerated on
# every build by scripts/inject_git_hash.py and packed into the FS image,
# but never committed — keeping it out of git is what stops the "version
# file dirty after every build" re-commit loop.
data/build_info.json
